    "updated_at": "2026-04-22T17:22:34Z",
    "body": "> they generally lack the cross-navigation persistence available to URL-keyed external resources\n\nI'm not sure this is generally true. Reportedly WebKit at least has some caching here.\n\nSome high-level feedback:\n\n1. This proposal is very light on evidence that this is a problem that needs solving. And that it needs solving in this particular manner with web developers directly influencing the inline script cache.\n2. Although the proposed name has \"hint\" in the name, the explainer at least seems to make normative requirements about behavior. That seems wrong, especially for something that cannot be directly observed.",
